%!PS
% Three pages for the reader and page-action tests: A4 portrait, Letter
% turned 90 degrees, A5 landscape. Each shows its number large, a border
% and a filled corner, so position, size and rotation can be checked in a
% rendering. The pdfmarks add bookmarks, links, a named destination, a
% note, an attachment and an OpenAction script. make.sh turns page two by
% 90 degrees with qpdf.

/big { /Helvetica-Bold findfont 72 scalefont setfont } def
/small { /Helvetica findfont 14 scalefont setfont } def
/frame { % w h
  /h exch def /w exch def
  0.2 0.3 0.8 setrgbcolor 4 setlinewidth 10 10 w 20 sub h 20 sub rectstroke
  0.9 0.2 0.2 setrgbcolor 10 10 60 60 rectfill
} def

[ /Title (pdfo test document) /Author (pdfo) /Subject (reader tests) /DOCINFO pdfmark
[ /Name (pdfo-note.txt) /FS << /Type /Filespec /F (pdfo-note.txt) /EF << /F [ /_objdef {att} /type /stream /OBJ pdfmark [ {att} (attached text\n) /PUT pdfmark [ {att} << /Type /EmbeddedFile >> /PUT pdfmark {att} >> >> /EMBED pdfmark
[ /_objdef {js} /type /dict /OBJ pdfmark
[ {js} << /S /JavaScript /JS (app.alert\('pdfo test'\);) >> /PUT pdfmark
[ {Catalog} << /OpenAction {js} >> /PUT pdfmark

% Page 1: A4
<< /PageSize [595 842] >> setpagedevice
595 842 frame
big 0 setgray 250 400 moveto (1) show
small 72 760 moveto (Page one: A4. Link to page three below.) show
[ /Dest /chapter3 /Rect [72 700 300 730] /Border [0 0 1] /Color [0 0 1] /Subtype /Link /ANN pdfmark
[ /Rect [72 650 300 680] /Border [0 0 1] /Action << /S /URI /URI (https://example.com/) >> /Subtype /Link /ANN pdfmark
[ /Rect [350 650 380 680] /Contents (A note on page one) /Open false /Subtype /Text /ANN pdfmark
[ /Title (Chapter 1) /Page 1 /View [/XYZ 0 842 null] /Count 1 /OUT pdfmark
[ /Title (Section 1.1) /Page 1 /View [/FitH 600] /OUT pdfmark
showpage

% Page 2: Letter, turned
<< /PageSize [612 792] >> setpagedevice
612 792 frame
big 0 setgray 260 380 moveto (2) show
small 72 720 moveto (Page two: Letter, rotated 90.) show
[ /Rect [72 600 300 630] /Border [0 0 1] /Page 1 /View [/XYZ 0 842 null] /Subtype /Link /ANN pdfmark
[ /Title (Chapter 2) /Page 2 /View [/Fit] /OUT pdfmark
showpage

% Page 3: A5 landscape
<< /PageSize [595 420] >> setpagedevice
595 420 frame
big 0 setgray 260 180 moveto (3) show
small 72 360 moveto (Page three: A5 landscape.) show
[ /Dest /chapter3 /View [/XYZ 0 420 null] /DEST pdfmark
[ /Title (Chapter 3) /Page 3 /View [/XYZ 0 420 null] /OUT pdfmark
showpage
